<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday Shagun ❤️</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff758c,#ff7eb3,#ffc3a0);
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    min-height:100vh;
    overflow:hidden;
}

.card{
    width:350px;
    background:white;
    border-radius:20px;
    text-align:center;
    padding:25px;
    box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
    z-index:10;
}

img{
    width:180px;
    height:180px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:5px solid #ff4f8b;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

h1{
    color:#ff2d75;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

h2{
    color:#444;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

p{
    color:#555;
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.6;
}

button{
    margin-top:20px;
    padding:12px 25px;
    border:none;
    background:#ff2d75;
    color:white;
    border-radius:30px;
    font-size:16px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:.3s;
}

button:hover{
    transform:scale(1.05);
    background:#e6005c;
}

#wish{
    margin-top:20px;
    color:#ff2d75;
    font-weight:bold;
    font-size:20px;
}

.heart{
    position:absolute;
    color:#ff2d75;
    animation:float 6s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes float{
    from{
        transform:translateY(100vh);
        opacity:1;
    }
    to{
        transform:translateY(-120vh);
        opacity:0;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

<img src="4E5F9025-D557-42A4-9C98-DB96C250902C.jpeg" alt="Shagun">

<h1>🎉 Happy Birthday Shagun! 🎂</h1>

<h2>To My Best Friend ❤️</h2>

<p>
Dear Shagun,<br><br>
You are my best friend, my biggest support, and one of the most special people in my life.
Thank you for always being there for me. I wish you endless happiness, success, love, and smiles.
May all your dreams come true. Stay blessed and keep shining forever. 💖
</p>

<button onclick="showMessage()">Click for a Surprise 🎁</button>

<div id="wish"></div>

</div>

<script>
function showMessage(){
document.getElementById("wish").innerHTML =
"❤️ Happy Birthday, Shagun! You'll always be my best friend. Love you and wish you a life full of happiness! 🎂🎈";
}

function hearts(){
let heart=document.createElement("div");
heart.className="heart";
heart.innerHTML="💖";
heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
heart.style.fontSize=(15+Math.random()*25)+"px";
heart.style.animationDuration=(4+Math.random()*3)+"s";
document.body.appendChild(heart);

setTimeout(()=>{
heart.remove();
},7000);
}

setInterval(hearts,250);
</script>

</body>
</html>
